---

# Loading Strategy

Each page supports

Initial Loading

Skeleton Loading

Incremental Loading

Background Refresh

Optimistic Updates

---

# Error Handling

Every mutation supports

Pending

Success

Failure

Retry

Rollback

Errors should never leave the application in an inconsistent state.

---

# Cache Strategy

Cache

Career Content

Learning Resources

Tools

FAQs

Communities

Salary

Do Not Cache

Progress

Notes

Achievements

Bookmarks

Portfolio

Notifications

