# Synchronization Rules

Completing a course automatically updates

Roadmap Progress

↓

Dashboard

↓

Career Progress

↓

Readiness Score

↓

Achievements

↓

Analytics

---

Completing a project updates

Portfolio

↓

Dashboard

↓

Career Readiness

↓

Profile

↓

Analytics

---

Passing a quiz updates

Quiz Progress

↓

Roadmap

↓

Career Readiness

↓

Dashboard

---

Earning a certificate updates

Certificates

↓

Resume

↓

Profile

↓

Career Score

↓

Dashboard

---

# Roadmap Logic

Each phase has

Locked

Available

In Progress

Completed

Users cannot skip required phases unless explicitly allowed.

Completion unlocks the next phase automatically.

---

# Progress Calculation

Career Readiness Score

Suggested default weights

Courses

25%

Projects

30%

Portfolio

20%

Quizzes

10%

Certificates

10%

Final Challenge

5%

Weights must be configurable.

Never hardcode.

---

# Completion Rules

A phase is complete only when

Required Courses

Completed

AND

Required Missions

Completed

AND

Quiz Passed

Optional content does not block progression.

---

# Notes Logic

Notes belong to

User

Career

Roadmap Phase (optional)

Project (optional)

Mission (optional)

Requirements

Auto Save

Version History (future)

Searchable

Markdown Support

---

# Bookmark Logic

Users may bookmark

Career

Course

Mission

Project

Tool

Company

Resource

Bookmarks are global.

---

# Search Logic

Global Search includes

Careers

Courses

Projects

Tools

Resources

Communities

Companies

Skills

FAQs

Notes

Results grouped by category.

---

# Dashboard Logic

Dashboard aggregates

Current Career

Learning Hours

Career Readiness

Projects

Portfolio

Certificates

Achievements

Daily Goals

Upcoming Missions

Recent Activity

Dashboard never owns data.

It only summarizes existing data.

---

# AI Mentor Logic

AI Mentor always receives context.

Available Context

Current Career

Completed Courses

Current Phase

Skill Gaps

Projects

Portfolio

Interview Readiness

Learning History

Goals

Recommendations must be personalized.

---

# Achievement Logic

Achievements unlock automatically.

Examples

First Login

First Career

First Project

Five Projects

Portfolio Complete

100-Day Streak

Job Ready

Achievements should never require manual updates.

---

# Notification Logic

Notifications generated automatically.

Examples

Phase Complete

Mission Due

New Recommendation

Certificate Earned

Streak Maintained

Interview Reminder

Notifications should be actionable.

---

# Offline Behavior

Users may browse cached content.

Mutations queue automatically.

Synchronization occurs once connectivity returns.

Conflicts resolved using server as source of truth.

---

# Undo Rules

Support undo where practical.

Examples

Delete Note

Remove Bookmark

Archive Project

Undo window should be time-limited.

---

# Autosave Rules

Automatically save

Notes

Draft Resume

Portfolio Description

Project Description

Settings

Profile

No explicit save button required.

---

# Permissions

Guest

Browse careers only

Authenticated User

Full learning experience

Premium (future)

Premium resources

Exclusive mentor features

Advanced analytics

Career coaching

---

# State Lifecycle

User Login

↓

Load Profile

↓

Load Dashboard

↓

Load Active Career

↓

Load Progress

↓

Load Recommendations

↓

