---

# Application Events

Examples

Career Started

Career Completed

Roadmap Started

Course Completed

Mission Completed

Project Submitted

Quiz Passed

Certificate Added

Resume Generated

Portfolio Published

Interview Scheduled

Every event should be available for analytics and future automation.

---

# Business Logic Rules

Business logic must never exist inside UI components.

Business logic belongs in

Server Actions

Services

Custom Hooks

Utility Functions

Domain Modules

UI components are responsible only for presentation and user interaction.

---

# Future Compatibility

The state architecture must support future features without redesign, including

- AI Agents
- Personalized AI Coaches
- Team Learning
- Mentor Chat Memory
- Gamification
- Career Marketplace
- Live Coding Assessments
- Employer Dashboards
- Learning Cohorts
- Mobile Applications

This specification defines the application state architecture for AI Career OS and must be followed by all future development and AI-generated code.